WEBVTT

00:18.460 --> 00:21.630
Lesley, Lesley! Meet Mr. Bunny!

00:34.460 --> 00:38.360
Ta-da! Now you'll be the BEST sniper ever!

00:40.960 --> 00:42.600
No! It's a decoy!

01:05.960 --> 01:06.930
I'm... sorry.

01:08.400 --> 01:09.730
Leave me alone...

01:35.860 --> 01:37.430
Over here, Ender!

02:28.730 --> 02:30.160
Great job, guys!
